# Primitive Tech Wiki - Static Site

This repository contains markdown files for the Primitive Tech Wiki.

GitHub Pages will serve these files as-is without Jekyll processing.

## Content Structure

All wiki content is stored in markdown files in the `wiki/` directory.

## Deployment

To view the site:
- Visit: https://ozymand1as.github.io/primitive_tech_wiki/
- Or deploy via GitHub Pages settings

## Adding Content

1. Create a new markdown file in the appropriate wiki directory
2. Ensure proper linking structure
3. Commit and push to trigger GitHub Pages rebuild
